'''Noxifer''' is a [[Farming]] plant grown in the [[Chambers of Xeric]] at level 55 Farming. Noxifer is grown by planting a [[noxifer seed]] in a [[Chambers of Xeric]] [[herb patch]]. A [[seed dibber]] is needed to plant the seed.
After 30 seconds, the planted seed will become [[Noxifer]]. 

Planting the Noxifer seeds gives 12 farming experience.

Each Noxifer, when picked, gives 30 farming experience. The Noxifer do not grow back after they are picked. The Noxifer may be picked after the plant is completely grown.
